ros-humble-segmentation-realsense-tutorial (2.3-4) jammy; urgency=low

  * Add a headless launch argument (default auto: when no display is
    available). Headless runs skip RViz and drop the RViz pipeline output
    that aborted openvino_node without a display.
  * Default to device:=AUTO: the GPU when available, otherwise the CPU.
    The device argument is now registered by name (launching without
    device:= failed before).
  * If the selected device is not available, stop and list the devices
    OpenVINO can use. End the launch when openvino_node exits.

 -- ECI Maintainer <eci.maintainer@intel.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

